    "custom_liquid_EQaYd3": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"page-width page-width--narrow-1\">\n<h2>Your Steps to Success</h2>\n<h3>Our simple training process will guarantee you're supported every step of the way.</h3>\n<ul class=\"green-white\">\n<li>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0861/8482/1048/files/location.png?v=1728039099\" alt=\"Pick a Location for your Test &amp; Tag Training in VIC\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<span>Pick a Location</span>\nTrain with us at the convenient VIC location or have one of our trainers come to you.\n</li>\n<li>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0861/8482/1048/files/one-day.png?v=1728035275\" alt=\"1 Day Test &amp; Tag Training Course in VIC\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<span>Learn in 1 Day</span>\nExperience a comprehensive full day course to have the skills and knowledge to succeed.\n</li>\n<li>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0861/8482/1048/files/certificate.png?v=1728035275\" alt=\"Get Certified\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<span>Get Certified</span>\nOnce completed, you'll receive an ID card with a personalised number.\n</li>\n<li>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0861/8482/1048/files/testers.png?v=1728035275\" alt=\"Take Advantage Of Exclusive Deals on Pat Testers &amp; Accessories\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<span>Equip Yourself</span>\nTake advantage of exclusive deals on PAT and accessories to help get you started.\n</li>\n<li class=\"green\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0861/8482/1048/files/support_e3b064d2-d5db-40d5-acef-0ea227859add.png?v=1728035275\" alt=\"Lifetime Support\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<span>Lifetime Support</span>\nWe're always there for you with full ongoing support via phone, email or instore.\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"mt20\">There are two types of courses for getting your test and tag license in VIC and both certify you as a 'competent person'. By Australian standards, this confirms you're capable of testing electrical appliances.</p>\n<p>If you are unsure of the difference between two courses, we can help you <a href=\"/pages/choosing-right-course\">choosing the right course</a>.</p>\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 20,
        "padding_bottom": 20
      }
    },
