    "image_with_text_LDYRnX": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_i8efiH": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Meet our VIC Trainer",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_DGDAbU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our Test & Tag Training Courses in Victoria are led by Mark Juric, a highly experienced resident trainer with over 20 years of hands-on experience in the electrotechnology industry. Mark combines his deep test and tag expertise with a solid background in teaching, making complex topics easy to understand for students of all levels.<br/><br/>Whether you're attending our face-to-face course at Caroline Springs or Rowville, or joining the online Test & Tag course via our Virtual Classroom, you’ll be learning from Mark. His approachable teaching style and in-depth knowledge of Australian Test & Tag standards ensure every student feels supported and confident throughout the course.<br/><br/>With Mark running your test and tag course, you’ll gain both practical skills and expert knowledge to apply test and tag in real-life scenarios. We guarantee you'll feel supported and have an enjoyable training experience. </p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
